Z||000011||WKDFIRO||02-02-2001||05:43 AM||||When the motor on the 87 coupe automatic finally went south I put in the steel cam gear. I could hear NO difference. Still can't after 20,000 miles.<P>Just in case anyone is interested...||||reg||1
